Disabled 2026-06-09. HiDream-I1 was an experimental MMDiT port layered on top of
the sd.cpp clone. It is parked (not applied, not built) but kept under version
control for reference. The build now follows vanilla upstream, which natively
supports Ideogram4 (PR leejet/stable-diffusion.cpp#1609, merged 2026-06-04) and
no longer needs -DSD_HIDREAM_I1_EXPERIMENTAL=ON.

To re-enable: delete this file. Get-SdCppPatchSets (sdcpp-patches\patch-lib.ps1)
skips any patch-set directory that contains a `.disabled` marker.
